      "name": "Editorial Caption",
      "role": "Image label and collection reference",
      "description": "Two-line block centered near the bottom of a full-bleed image. Line 1 in 12px uppercase (collection name, e.g. 'WOMEN'S SUMMER 25'). Line 2 in 10-11px uppercase (call to discover, e.g. 'DESCUBRE LA SELECCIÓN DE BOLSO'). White (#ffffff) over dark photography, letter-spacing 1.5-2px. No background, no button chrome — the caption is the call to action."
